        {
          "id": "10b35cac-9614-3b0f-a5af-f2f65b6f1439",
          "content": {
            "id": "10b35cac-9614-3b0f-a5af-f2f65b6f1439",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Roomba maker iRobot, once Amazon's takeover target, flags going concern risk",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "\"Given macroeconomic and tariff-related uncertainties, there is substantial doubt about iRobot's ability to continue as a going concern,\" iRobot said in a statement.  The vacuum cleaner maker is having a hard time keeping up with Chinese rivals such as Ecovacs Robotics, which offer advanced features at lower prices.  In August 2022, iRobot had agreed to a $61-per-share takeover by Amazon, a deal some analysts viewed as a lifeline for the company and a potential enhancement for Amazon's smart home division.",
            "pubDate": "2025-03-12T20:02:50Z",
