        {
          "id": "ed50c2b8-db3e-337c-9a32-5264eaa77397",
          "content": {
            "id": "ed50c2b8-db3e-337c-9a32-5264eaa77397",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "iRobot stock dives on its 'substantial doubt' of surviving in 2025",
            "description": "<p>iRobot (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/IRBT\">IRBT</a>) stock is plummeting by nearly 35% ahead of Wednesday's market close <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/irobot-target-novo-nordisk-vs-161013648.html\">after the Roomba-maker warned</a> about the company's \"substantial doubt\" of its ability to continue. This comes over a year after its deal with Amazon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>) fell through</p>\n<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> report more on iRobot's negative stock moves.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">here</a>.</p>",
